OL,3,GNEWSACouncil fury at neglect of 17th
OL,4,ACentury hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leader of a council considering
OL,7,Fspending #250,000 to protect a 17th
OL,8,FCentury Grade II listed hotel has
OL,9,Fdemanded the owner faces consequences
OL,10,Ffor neglecting it.
OL,12,FCarl Smith, Conservative leader of
OL,13,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council, said it
OL,14,Fwas unfair the authority was having to
OL,15,Fuse taxpayers' money for urgent repairs
OL,16,Fon the now-derelict Star Hotel.
OL,18,FThe North Quay building has strong
OL,19,Fhistorical links to Charles Dickens and
OL,20,FAdmiral Lord Nelson, but has become a
OL,21,Ftarget for anti-social behaviour since
OL,22,F2020.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
