OL,4,ACentury hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther action could force the sale of
OL,7,Fthe building through a compulsory
OL,8,Fpurchase order and the council has also
OL,9,Freported the owners to the police over
OL,10,Fsuspected fraud.
